uote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1321083-where-are-narwhal-totem-stats?p=1321088#post1321088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Narwhal is part of Unicorns brood. Though there are Narwhal spirit stats ( Axis Mundi pg. 104) there are none for taking Narwhal as a totem. I think using Unicorn or Dolphin would probably work, or do some research on Narwhal folklore if you want to make your own.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! My plans for a Ragabash Child of Gaia advocated to fight the weaver is one step closer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}